{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>9月1日，宇樹科技昨日晚間曬出一段視頻，展示了其四足機械人消防應急解決方案。從視頻可以看到，宇樹展示了A2-W背負機器狗、B2智能水炮機器狗、A2-W偵測機器狗、B2偵測機器狗、As2雲台偵查機器狗、B2衞星偵查機器狗、A2-W建模機器狗等產品，還有不怕火燒的B2耐高温機器狗。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/a4e60c946c64757.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/62c26681b979e80.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/803e49191360c8a.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/749ce3099281e51.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/42ed2a0fba9c8f6.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/e057c00ae7b2b1d.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/8d830cbf305c03a.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/befb840f644fcb3.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/d6bc7eb9ebde33e.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/f3b0d9937650c35.png\">\n</p>\n<p>消防員可通過機器狗與被困人員進行雙向語音對講。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/9f47c5cdb9319bb.png\">\n</p>\n\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/a4e60c946c64757.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/62c26681b979e80.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/803e49191360c8a.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/749ce3099281e51.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/42ed2a0fba9c8f6.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/e057c00ae7b2b1d.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/8d830cbf305c03a.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/befb840f644fcb3.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/d6bc7eb9ebde33e.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/f3b0d9937650c35.png\">\n</p>\n\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/9f47c5cdb9319bb.png\">\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T04:58:37.189207+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":22,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}